WEBVTT

1
00:53:00.514 --> 00:53:03.514
You know church, we were just singing a song before this.

2
00:53:03.514 --> 00:53:06.514
I wrote down the words for a moment. We had sung You are my one thing.

3
00:53:06.514 --> 00:53:10.514
I don't want anyone else. I don't want anything else.

4
00:53:10.514 --> 00:53:12.514
And you know, you can sit down for a moment.

5
00:53:12.514 --> 00:53:17.514
You know, when you sing these words, I explain this more often.

6
00:53:17.514 --> 00:53:22.514
When you sing these words, it is twofold what you are doing there.

7
00:53:22.514 --> 00:53:27.514
On one hand, it is a prayer about yourself, on the other hand, it is self-reflection.

8
00:53:27.514 --> 00:53:34.514
I repeat, when you sing, you are my one thing, I don't want anyone else.

9
00:53:34.514 --> 00:53:36.514
I don't want anything else.

10
00:53:36.514 --> 00:53:42.514
On one hand, that is a prayer about your soul, on the other hand, it is self-reflection,

11
00:53:42.514 --> 00:53:46.514
a challenge for yourself, a referendum to yourself, I might say.

12
00:53:46.514 --> 00:53:52.514
On one hand, you can sing this because you are speaking it over yourself,

13
00:53:52.514 --> 00:53:57.514
that you want Jesus to be everything and all for you in life.

14
00:53:57.514 --> 00:54:08.514
And no one in this room, no one in this room is perfect in their complete desire for Jesus.

15
00:54:08.514 --> 00:54:11.514
No one. No one is perfect in that.

16
00:54:11.514 --> 00:54:18.514
So when we sing this, you are my one thing, there is nothing else.

17
00:54:18.514 --> 00:54:23.514
There is absolutely nothing in life that is more important than Jesus.

18
00:54:23.514 --> 00:54:28.514
We all fall short in that. All of us.

19
00:54:28.514 --> 00:54:33.514
And then you might think to yourself, when you are here in the room,

20
00:54:33.514 --> 00:54:38.514
you might think, yes that is hyperbolic language, that is a sentence I cannot sing,

21
00:54:38.514 --> 00:54:41.514
for I don't always feel that way at all.

22
00:54:41.514 --> 00:54:45.514
I often have an interest in this or I want to have that.

23
00:54:45.514 --> 00:54:52.514
And when we sing, I don't want anything else, that means there is nothing I want except Jesus.

24
00:54:52.514 --> 00:54:55.514
There is nothing as important as Jesus.

25
00:54:55.514 --> 00:55:01.514
And so often our thoughts go on, I want this, I want to go there, that is an ambition of mine,

26
00:55:01.514 --> 00:55:05.514
that is important, that is urgent, I worry about that,

27
00:55:05.514 --> 00:55:09.514
I have been busy with that which I know I shouldn't have been busy with.

28
00:55:09.514 --> 00:55:11.514
And we all go through that.

29
00:55:11.514 --> 00:55:13.514
And then you come to the church and we sing this.

30
00:55:13.514 --> 00:55:16.514
And then you think to yourself, yes who am I to sing this?

31
00:55:16.514 --> 00:55:22.514
But I want to advise you, I want to motivate you, do sing this especially.

32
00:55:22.514 --> 00:55:30.514
Whatever you feel, whatever you think, whatever occupies you, where you can honestly say.

33
00:55:30.514 --> 00:55:36.514
Often I do not put Jesus in the first place, but does this concern come in the first place?

34
00:55:36.514 --> 00:55:39.514
Or does this ambition come in the first place?

35
00:55:39.514 --> 00:55:43.514
Or am I secretly busy with that, while I know I shouldn't have been?

36
00:55:43.514 --> 00:55:49.514
Then do sing this especially, for it is a prayer that you speak over yourself.

37
00:55:49.514 --> 00:55:53.514
That you say, Lord, I want you to be in the first place.

38
00:55:53.514 --> 00:55:55.514
So do sing it especially with your whole heart.

39
00:55:55.514 --> 00:56:00.514
Even though sometimes you think to yourself, yes then I am a hypocrite if I sing it.

40
00:56:00.514 --> 00:56:04.514
No, you are not a hypocrite, you are speaking words of life over your soul.

41
00:56:04.514 --> 00:56:06.514
Does everyone understand what I mean?

42
00:56:06.514 --> 00:56:08.514
And at the same time, it is also a reflection.

43
00:56:08.514 --> 00:56:14.514
Because when you sing this, and here is a challenge that I sometimes set for myself.

44
00:56:14.514 --> 00:56:21.514
When you sing this and you think to yourself, hey, this immediately comes to mind.

45
00:56:21.514 --> 00:56:28.514
This topic immediately comes to mind, of which I know, when I say, you are my one thing.

46
00:56:28.514 --> 00:56:30.514
There is no one else.

47
00:56:30.514 --> 00:56:32.514
There is nothing else.

48
00:56:33.514 --> 00:56:36.514
And immediately your soul begins to speak to you, yes.

49
00:56:36.514 --> 00:56:39.514
Well, what about what you've been busy with all week?

50
00:56:39.514 --> 00:56:44.514
Tackle that then, in the days that follow.

51
00:56:44.514 --> 00:56:47.514
Work on that together with God.

52
00:56:47.514 --> 00:56:50.514
Because then it is the Holy Spirit who says, hey, wait a minute Tim.

53
00:56:50.514 --> 00:56:56.514
You sing this, but I want to guide you to that place where you also love me alone.

54
00:56:56.514 --> 00:56:58.514
Shall we tackle this together?

55
00:56:58.514 --> 00:57:03.514
And that can be anything, career, partnership, whatever in life.

56
00:57:03.514 --> 00:57:05.514
Things that occupy you, but also sins.

57
00:57:05.514 --> 00:57:09.514
That God says, there is something that stands between you and me.

58
00:57:09.514 --> 00:57:13.514
Shall we tackle this together, so that we can remove it?

59
00:57:13.514 --> 00:57:16.514
So that you and I have an open channel with each other.

60
00:57:16.514 --> 00:57:19.514
Do you understand why it is so important that we worship together?

61
00:57:19.514 --> 00:57:22.514
And that we also know what we are singing?

62
00:57:22.514 --> 00:57:24.514
Travel well.

63
00:57:24.514 --> 00:57:26.514
Hallelujah.

64
00:57:27.514 --> 00:57:31.514
I loved it. I thought it was great.

65
00:57:31.514 --> 00:57:34.514
Ruben, you may invite him to the stage.

66
00:57:34.514 --> 00:57:37.514
For the collections.

67
00:57:37.514 --> 00:57:40.514
I want to say one thing.

68
00:57:40.514 --> 00:57:44.514
Right after the service, if you weren't here last week.

69
00:57:44.514 --> 00:57:46.514
I have received several messages and questions.

70
00:57:46.514 --> 00:57:49.514
If you weren't here last week.

71
00:57:49.514 --> 00:57:56.514
Last week we gave all the people in Openkerk a blessing for 2025.

72
00:57:56.514 --> 00:57:58.514
With an anointing of oil.

73
00:57:58.514 --> 00:58:00.514
If you weren't here last week.

74
00:58:00.514 --> 00:58:04.514
For work, or maybe you happened to be away for work.

75
00:58:04.514 --> 00:58:08.514
Or you happened to be sick, or you happened to be away on vacation.

76
00:58:08.514 --> 00:58:12.514
And you still want that anointing and that blessing.

77
00:58:12.514 --> 00:58:14.514
Then come to us after the service.

78
00:58:14.514 --> 00:58:17.514
We would like to give you an anointing anyway.

79
00:58:17.514 --> 00:58:19.514
Unless you didn't feel like it last week.

80
00:58:19.514 --> 00:58:21.514
Because then we will push you out.

81
00:58:21.514 --> 00:58:23.514
Amen.

82
00:58:23.514 --> 00:58:25.514
Praise God.

83
00:58:25.514 --> 00:58:27.514
Praise God.

84
00:58:31.514 --> 00:58:36.514
I think it is good to remain in this worship.

85
00:58:36.514 --> 00:58:42.514
Giving absolutely becomes part of worship.

86
00:58:42.514 --> 00:58:45.514
I actually want the text that I shared last week.

87
00:58:45.514 --> 00:58:49.514
That I would give a testimony about giving in my own life.

88
00:58:49.514 --> 00:58:54.514
And I really want the text that I read last week from Hebrews.

89
00:58:54.514 --> 00:58:57.514
Eleven verse 1 on the screen.

90
00:58:57.514 --> 00:58:59.514
And I would like to have that up there.

91
00:58:59.514 --> 00:59:02.514
Because while I tell my story.

92
00:59:02.514 --> 00:59:05.514
While I actually do this piece.

93
00:59:05.514 --> 00:59:11.514
We must understand well that I do this against the background of this.

94
00:59:11.514 --> 00:59:13.514
What faith is.

95
00:59:13.514 --> 00:59:16.514
And when I use the word faith.

96
00:59:16.514 --> 00:59:20.514
I want to know that you know what the Bible says about it.

97
00:59:20.514 --> 00:59:22.514
And this is it.

98
00:59:22.514 --> 00:59:25.514
Because faith for me is not.

99
00:59:25.514 --> 00:59:28.514
I hope somewhere that it will come.

100
00:59:28.514 --> 00:59:31.514
I assume that there is something.

101
00:59:31.514 --> 00:59:33.514
And maybe it will be there someday.

102
00:59:33.514 --> 00:59:37.514
No, it is the certainty of the things we expect.

103
00:59:38.514 --> 00:59:41.514
And it is the evidence of the things we do not yet see.

104
00:59:41.514 --> 00:59:44.514
And when we start to apply that in our lives.

105
00:59:44.514 --> 00:59:46.514
Also with giving.

106
00:59:46.514 --> 00:59:48.514
But also what Tim just shared.

107
00:59:48.514 --> 00:59:51.514
In everything where we involve God.

108
00:59:51.514 --> 00:59:53.514
Maybe we do not see it now.

109
00:59:53.514 --> 00:59:55.514
But it is coming.

110
00:59:55.514 --> 00:59:57.514
And it is a certainty.

111
00:59:58.514 --> 01:00:02.514
I actually want to read Isaiah 43 at the same time.

112
01:00:02.514 --> 01:00:05.514
Before I actually give that testimony.

113
01:00:06.514 --> 01:00:08.514
Verses 18 and 19.

114
01:00:09.514 --> 01:00:12.514
I did not pass it on because I really want to read it.

115
01:00:13.514 --> 01:00:18.514
It is about a part in Isaiah where God says the following to His people.

116
01:00:18.514 --> 01:00:20.514
And also says to us.

117
01:00:21.514 --> 01:00:26.514
But it is nothing compared to what I am about to do now.

118
01:00:27.514 --> 01:00:29.514
We do not see that yet.

119
01:00:29.514 --> 01:00:33.514
But it is nothing compared to what I am going to do.

120
01:00:34.514 --> 01:00:37.514
For I am planning something very new.

121
01:00:38.514 --> 01:00:41.514
Are we excited about that? I have something very new in mind.

122
01:00:42.514 --> 01:00:44.514
Look. Look.

123
01:00:44.514 --> 01:00:47.514
We don't see it yet, but I have already started it, says God.

124
01:00:49.514 --> 01:00:51.514
Don't you see it?

125
01:00:52.514 --> 01:00:54.514
That is exactly what faith does.

126
01:00:54.514 --> 01:00:56.514
Do we see it? Or do we not see it?

127
01:00:56.514 --> 01:00:58.514
But He is going to do it.

128
01:00:59.514 --> 01:01:00.514
And what does God do?

129
01:01:00.514 --> 01:01:05.514
I will make a way through the wilderness of the world for my people to return home.

130
01:01:06.514 --> 01:01:07.514
What did we just sing?

131
01:01:07.514 --> 01:01:10.514
Come, Lord Jesus, come. We are on our way home.

132
01:01:11.514 --> 01:01:15.514
I will make rivers spring up for my people in the desert.

133
01:01:16.514 --> 01:01:20.514
I don't know if you notice that, but making rivers spring up in the desert is something abnormal.

134
01:01:21.514 --> 01:01:23.514
It is not what we encounter in the desert.

135
01:01:24.514 --> 01:01:25.514
A river.

136
01:01:25.514 --> 01:01:27.514
And that is what God does. We don't see it yet.

137
01:01:28.514 --> 01:01:29.514
In giving.

138
01:01:30.514 --> 01:01:33.514
I have struggled with that for a long time and I am very honest about it.

139
01:01:34.514 --> 01:01:37.514
About giving from my income.

140
01:01:38.514 --> 01:01:41.514
We often hear 10% here on the stage.

141
01:01:42.514 --> 01:01:47.514
I don't often express this, because it's difficult for me to give 10%.

142
01:01:48.514 --> 01:01:52.514
But at some point, I actually took on the challenge.

143
01:01:52.514 --> 01:01:54.514
Because I thought, why do I want this?

144
01:01:55.514 --> 01:01:58.514
Does God need my money? No.

145
01:01:59.514 --> 01:02:01.514
But it does testify to obedience.

146
01:02:02.514 --> 01:02:06.514
And it does testify to gratitude for what He has done for me.

147
01:02:07.514 --> 01:02:11.514
And if God says one thing in His Word, then I want to apply the other as well.

148
01:02:12.514 --> 01:02:13.514
And that is giving.

149
01:02:14.514 --> 01:02:16.514
And I don't know if you know this, but some do.

150
01:02:17.514 --> 01:02:19.514
I am trained as an accountant, bookkeeper.

151
01:02:20.514 --> 01:02:23.514
I don't immediately fall asleep when I say that.

152
01:02:24.514 --> 01:02:26.514
But they are also needed in this world.

153
01:02:28.514 --> 01:02:31.514
And I was really... I started with an Excel sheet.

154
01:02:32.514 --> 01:02:33.514
This comes in.

155
01:02:34.514 --> 01:02:36.514
As if I don't know that from outside, but this comes in.

156
01:02:37.514 --> 01:02:40.514
And I wanted to give exactly 10% of what came in.

157
01:02:43.514 --> 01:02:45.514
And then I got a very nice overview.

158
01:02:45.514 --> 01:02:46.514
And I deposited.

159
01:02:47.514 --> 01:02:49.514
But that was a shortcoming towards God.

160
01:02:50.514 --> 01:02:52.514
Somehow I felt like...

161
01:02:53.514 --> 01:02:55.514
I treat my tithe like an invoice.

162
01:02:56.514 --> 01:02:57.514
With a due date.

163
01:03:00.514 --> 01:03:01.514
Yes.

164
01:03:02.514 --> 01:03:03.514
I thought, well, I will pay that.

165
01:03:04.514 --> 01:03:05.514
But it's not happening yet.

166
01:03:06.514 --> 01:03:07.514
So it will come.

167
01:03:08.514 --> 01:03:09.514
Yes. So I will...

168
01:03:10.514 --> 01:03:11.514
Is that clear, the due date?

169
01:03:12.514 --> 01:03:13.514
For most, perhaps yes.

170
01:03:13.514 --> 01:03:17.514
But it comes down to when you receive an energy bill.

171
01:03:18.514 --> 01:03:20.514
I work for the energy regulator, so I choose an energy bill.

172
01:03:22.514 --> 01:03:25.514
It has a due date and you think, I will pay then.

173
01:03:26.514 --> 01:03:28.514
And that's how it is. But God has no due date.

174
01:03:29.514 --> 01:03:31.514
But I thought, I apply a due date.

175
01:03:32.514 --> 01:03:34.514
And at a certain point, I really felt like, I've had enough.

176
01:03:35.514 --> 01:03:36.514
I really want to do this.

177
01:03:37.514 --> 01:03:39.514
I want to be obedient to what His Word says.

178
01:03:40.514 --> 01:03:41.514
I also want to show my gratitude.

179
01:03:41.514 --> 01:03:42.514
I also want to show my gratitude.

180
01:03:43.514 --> 01:03:46.514
Not just by being here in the church and being present.

181
01:03:47.514 --> 01:03:48.514
And to honor and to praise God.

182
01:03:49.514 --> 01:03:50.514
That all belongs to it as well.

183
01:03:51.514 --> 01:03:53.514
But also this giving, also this piece of finances.

184
01:03:54.514 --> 01:03:56.514
He has so many promises about that.

185
01:03:58.514 --> 01:04:00.514
And at a certain point, I really felt like, I came...

186
01:04:01.514 --> 01:04:03.514
The balance was really an amount that I thought of...

187
01:04:04.514 --> 01:04:05.514
God, can I miss this now?

188
01:04:07.514 --> 01:04:08.514
But it is yours.

189
01:04:09.514 --> 01:04:11.514
And at a certain point, I really had the feeling of...

190
01:04:12.514 --> 01:04:13.514
I just write it over.

191
01:04:14.514 --> 01:04:15.514
It is yours. It is his.

192
01:04:17.514 --> 01:04:19.514
And what he also showed me at the same time when I did that,

193
01:04:20.514 --> 01:04:22.514
a joy, a peace came into my heart.

194
01:04:24.514 --> 01:04:26.514
Some of you know what I'm talking about.

195
01:04:27.514 --> 01:04:29.514
Others do not, but you may not see it yet.

196
01:04:30.514 --> 01:04:32.514
But believe that God has a plan with that as well.

197
01:04:34.514 --> 01:04:36.514
And now I have the feeling where God clearly showed me

198
01:04:36.514 --> 01:04:38.514
in my giving, is from...

199
01:04:40.514 --> 01:04:43.514
Give to me before you spend anything else.

200
01:04:45.514 --> 01:04:49.514
Even before you, so to speak, buy a loaf of bread.

201
01:04:53.514 --> 01:04:54.514
Without an expiration date.

202
01:04:55.514 --> 01:04:57.514
Give immediately to the Lord.

203
01:04:59.514 --> 01:05:01.514
And believe that He will do something with it.

204
01:05:01.514 --> 01:05:03.514
And that is what is written in Hebrews 11, verse 1.

205
01:05:04.514 --> 01:05:08.514
Faith is the assurance that the things we hope for will also become reality.

206
01:05:09.514 --> 01:05:12.514
It is a proof of the things we do not yet see.

207
01:05:13.514 --> 01:05:15.514
Challenge God, for that is what He asks for.

208
01:05:16.514 --> 01:05:18.514
We just talked about it with someone before the service.

209
01:05:19.514 --> 01:05:20.514
Challenge God.

210
01:05:21.514 --> 01:05:22.514
Also in this area of your life.

211
01:05:23.514 --> 01:05:24.514
And I want to bless you.

212
01:05:25.514 --> 01:05:27.514
And I hope that testimonies may come forth.

213
01:05:28.514 --> 01:05:29.514
Just as I have a testimony of...

214
01:05:29.514 --> 01:05:30.514
God deserves this.

215
01:05:33.514 --> 01:05:34.514
He has given everything for us.

216
01:05:35.514 --> 01:05:37.514
He deserves this giving in our lives.

217
01:05:38.514 --> 01:05:40.514
And I bless you with that in the name of Jesus. Amen.

218
01:05:50.514 --> 01:05:51.514
Amen.

219
01:05:52.514 --> 01:05:53.514
It is good to hear testimonies.

220
01:05:54.514 --> 01:05:55.514
Amen.

221
01:05:55.514 --> 01:05:56.514
Amen.

222
01:05:58.514 --> 01:06:07.514
We always say, you cannot encourage what you do not also practice yourself.

223
01:06:14.514 --> 01:06:18.514
It would be strange if someone here encourages us to give what he himself does not also give.

224
01:06:19.514 --> 01:06:20.514
The one who preaches it, lives it.

225
01:06:21.514 --> 01:06:22.514
That is how it should be.

226
01:06:23.514 --> 01:06:25.514
For we preach with conviction.

227
01:06:26.514 --> 01:06:27.514
Amen.

228
01:06:31.514 --> 01:06:32.514
I have good news for you.

229
01:06:38.514 --> 01:06:40.514
Shall we get excited about fasting?

230
01:06:44.514 --> 01:06:45.514
I am looking forward to it.

231
01:06:46.514 --> 01:06:47.514
And do you know why?

232
01:06:49.514 --> 01:06:50.514
Not because I am hungry.

233
01:06:51.514 --> 01:06:52.514
What does happen.

234
01:06:54.514 --> 01:06:55.514
But because of what God does.

235
01:06:58.514 --> 01:06:59.514
And in the past four years...

236
01:07:07.514 --> 01:07:10.514
For the past four years, we have fasted together as a household.

237
01:07:17.514 --> 01:07:19.514
And from the first year, we have seen breakthrough.

238
01:07:20.514 --> 01:07:21.514
Without going into details.

239
01:07:22.514 --> 01:07:24.514
People have become healthy.

240
01:07:28.514 --> 01:07:30.514
And people were freed from things.

241
01:07:32.514 --> 01:07:34.514
God uses the space...

242
01:07:36.514 --> 01:07:37.514
to speak...

243
01:07:38.514 --> 01:07:42.514
and to do things that are supernatural, that are spiritual...

244
01:07:45.514 --> 01:07:47.514
that we do not fully understand.

245
01:07:47.514 --> 01:07:49.514
That we do not fully understand.

246
01:07:54.514 --> 01:07:58.514
So when I talked with some of the young people yesterday about fasting and they had questions...

247
01:08:09.514 --> 01:08:14.514
Then I cannot fully explain why giving up food for a moment...

248
01:08:15.514 --> 01:08:17.514
gives a spiritual sensitivity, but it does.

249
01:08:27.514 --> 01:08:31.514
The Lord uses that space in your time and in your soul to speak to us.

250
01:08:37.514 --> 01:08:41.514
And we are not just giving something up. The idea is to fill that with God.

