01:45:37.514 --> 01:45:49.514
I have taken this approach to show why we are making a few small changes in the church.

708
01:45:49.514 --> 01:45:54.514
So hold on to this sermon for a moment.

709
01:45:55.514 --> 01:46:05.514
What we want to create as a church is a kingdom culture where the believers of Open Church come to the church,

710
01:46:05.514 --> 01:46:12.514
to worship God together and reign as the Kingdom of God in the place where God has set you.

711
01:46:12.514 --> 01:46:16.514
Where you live, God has placed you there now.

712
01:46:16.514 --> 01:46:23.514
Yes, I chose my own house on EmoWeb, I understand that, but God has placed you there now.

713
01:46:23.514 --> 01:46:25.514
God has placed you there.

714
01:46:25.514 --> 01:46:29.514
Where you live, you are the king of that neighborhood.

715
01:46:29.514 --> 01:46:32.514
That sounds arrogant, doesn't it?

716
01:46:32.514 --> 01:46:37.514
I sometimes say, when I am walking, I sometimes say,

717
01:46:37.514 --> 01:46:40.514
Lord, you have placed me here as governor of this place.

718
01:46:40.514 --> 01:46:42.514
