719
01:46:42.514 --> 01:46:43.514
Why governor?

720
01:46:43.514 --> 01:46:49.514
Because a governor is someone who may reign in the place, may guide in the place.

721
01:46:49.514 --> 01:46:54.514
God has placed me in this neighborhood as a king of this place.

722
01:46:54.514 --> 01:46:56.514
And that is not arrogance, that is biblical.

723
01:46:56.514 --> 01:47:01.514
And what I need to do is consult with the Father about what needs to happen in my neighborhood.

724
01:47:01.514 --> 01:47:05.514
And when I see that, I walk past a house and pray for healing,

725
01:47:05.514 --> 01:47:09.514
I don't know what is happening behind those doors, but healing needs to take place.

726
01:47:09.514 --> 01:47:13.514
If I see an occult sign, I break that sign or I throw it away myself.

727
01:47:14.514 --> 01:47:18.514
But it's really true, right, it's really true, right.

728
01:47:18.514 --> 01:47:22.514
With Joshua and Olivia, we drive by and there was a Buddha statue in one of those gardens.

729
01:47:22.514 --> 01:47:26.514
