736
01:47:45.514 --> 01:47:48.514
And I pray that these people will come to know Jesus.

737
01:47:48.514 --> 01:47:51.514
We prayed this for about a month or so, bam, Buddha statue gone.

738
01:47:51.514 --> 01:47:55.514
And Joshua and Olivia, what, what.

739
01:47:55.514 --> 01:47:58.514
And inside me, what.

740
01:47:58.514 --> 01:48:02.514
But outside, of course, of course.

741
01:48:05.514 --> 01:48:08.514
That is really true, that is really true.

742
01:48:13.514 --> 01:48:17.514
And I don't want to throw mud anymore, but I really dislike pride flags.

743
01:48:17.514 --> 01:48:19.514
I just dislike them.

744
01:48:19.514 --> 01:48:21.514
Sorry for saying it from the podium.

745
01:48:21.514 --> 01:48:22.514
I dislike them.

746
01:48:22.514 --> 01:48:26.514
So also in our neighborhood, museum and all those pride flags.

747
01:48:26.514 --> 01:48:28.514
It just doesn't belong, that's it.

748
01:48:28.514 --> 01:48:31.514
The rainbow of Noah is a promise for God's kingdom.

749
01:48:31.514 --> 01:48:33.514
And the rest, no.

