753
01:48:40.514 --> 01:48:43.514
And that's not nonsense and that's not bragging.

754
01:48:43.514 --> 01:48:47.514
But it is, God has placed you in the place where you live.

755
01:48:47.514 --> 01:48:54.514
In your family, in your work, in your job, in your class, in your village, in your area.

756
01:48:54.514 --> 01:48:57.514
Limburg, Kempen, whatever.

757
01:48:57.514 --> 01:49:02.514
But your kingship in the name of Jesus is as great as your faith.

758
01:49:02.514 --> 01:49:08.514
